# Code Organization

Prefer focused modules:

```text
src/
├── agent/          # session, lifecycle, state, prompts
├── tools/
├── integrations/   # livekit, openai, telephony
├── services/
├── repositories/
├── models/
├── config/
├── observability/
└── main.py
```

Keep: transport separate from business logic; prompts separate from tools; DB access in repositories; external APIs in integration clients; validation separate from execution; post-call processing separate from realtime conversation processing.
